<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SPORITELNA CZK632 MLN H1 NET -IAS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SPORITELNA CZK632 MLN H1 NET -IAS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six month period ending June 30, 1997 to international accounting standards (in billions of crowns).</p>
<p>				    H1 1997	VS     H1 1997</p>
<p> AFTER TAX PROFIT	     0.632		   1.392</p>
<p> NET INTEREST INCOME	  7.226		   6.695</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME	     0.536		   1.530</p>
<p> OPERATING EXPENSES	   5.712		   5.138</p>
<p> PROVISIONS		     1.418		   1.695</p>
<p> FEES AND COMMISSIONS	 1.329		   0.720</p>
<p>DEPRECIATION AND AMORTIZATION</p>
<p>				    1.140		   0.895</p>
<p> BALANCE SHEET TOTAL	348.0		   339.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Sporitelna said in a statement that the result was &quot;affected mainly by adjustments for securities which totalled 1.3 billion crowns&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Dusan Bucanek, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
